msgid ""
"The server has started successfully if the log outputs: `vLLM API server "
"started on 0.0.0.0:8003`."
msgstr "如果日志输出 `vLLM API server started on 0.0.0.0:8003`，则表示服务器已成功启动。"

msgid ""
"vLLM-Ascend supports Dynamic Chunked Pipeline Parallel (CPP) for optimizing "
"prefill performance in Pipeline Parallelism scenarios. This feature is "
"supported starting from version `v0.19.1rc1`."
msgstr ""
"vLLM-Ascend 支持动态分块流水线并行（CPP），用于优化流水线并行场景下的预填充性能。此功能自版本 `v0.19.1rc1` 起支持。"

msgid ""
"**CPP is designed to be used on the P (Prefiller) node in Prefill-Decode "
"(PD) disaggregation deployments.** The D (Decoder) node does not require CPP"
" configuration. By dynamically calculating the optimal chunk size based on "
"profiling data, CPP significantly reduces Time-To-First-Token (TTFT) for "
"long sequences on P nodes."
msgstr ""
"**CPP 专为预填充-解码（PD）分离部署中的 P（预填充）节点设计。** D（解码）节点无需配置 "
"CPP。通过基于性能分析数据动态计算最优分块大小，CPP 可显著降低 P 节点上长序列的首令牌时间（TTFT）。"

msgid ""
"This guide demonstrates PD disaggregation deployment with DeepSeek-V3.1 on 3"
" Atlas 800T A3 servers (64GB × 16): one server acts as the Prefiller (P "
"node, with CPP enabled) and two servers act as the Decoder (D nodes, without"
" CPP, DP32 standard configuration)."
msgstr ""
"本指南演示了在 3 台 Atlas 800T A3 服务器（64GB × 16）上使用 DeepSeek-V3.1 进行 PD "
"分离部署：一台服务器作为预填充节点（P 节点，启用 CPP），两台服务器作为解码节点（D 节点，不启用 CPP，采用 DP32 标准配置）。"

msgid ""
"For complete PD disaggregation setup instructions (environment verification,"
" Mooncake installation, proxy deployment), see:"
msgstr "有关完整的 PD 分离设置说明（环境验证、Mooncake 安装、代理部署），请参阅："

msgid ""
"- [PD Disaggregation Single Node (Qwen2.5-VL)](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_single_node.md)\n"
"- [PD Disaggregation Multi Node (DeepSeek)](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)"
msgstr ""
"- [PD 分离单节点（Qwen2.5-VL）](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_single_node.md)\n"
"- [PD 分离多节点（DeepSeek）](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)"

msgid ""
"- `DeepSeek-V3.1-W8A8` (Quantized version): 1 Atlas 800T A3 (64GB × 16) node"
msgstr "- `DeepSeek-V3.1-W8A8`（量化版本）：1 台 Atlas 800T A3（64GB × 16）节点"

msgid "Start a Docker container on each node."
msgstr "在每个节点上启动 Docker 容器。"

msgid "### Install Mooncake"
msgstr "### 安装 Mooncake"

msgid ""
"Mooncake is required for PD disaggregation KV cache transfer. Refer to [PD "
"Disaggregation Multi Node - Install "
"Mooncake](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#install-mooncake) for "
"installation and compilation steps."
msgstr ""
"PD 分离的 KV 缓存传输需要 Mooncake。有关安装和编译步骤，请参阅 [PD 分离多节点 - 安装 "
"Mooncake](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md#install-mooncake)。"

msgid ""
"In a PD disaggregation setup, enable CPP **only on the P (Prefiller) node**."
" The D (Decoder) node runs without pipeline parallelism and focuses on low-"
"latency token-by-token decoding."
msgstr "在 PD 分离部署中，**仅在 P（预填充）节点上**启用 CPP。D（解码）节点不启用流水线并行，专注于低延迟的逐令牌解码。"

msgid ""
"- It is recommended to use `MooncakeConnectorV1` as the `kv_connector`, as it provides more comprehensive support for PP.\n"
"    - It is recommended **not** to enable `async-scheduling` on P nodes of PP, as it may cause performance degradation in the prefill stage."
msgstr ""
"- 建议使用 `MooncakeConnectorV1` 作为 `kv_connector`，因为它对 PP 提供了更全面的支持。\n"
"    - 建议**不要**在 PP 的 P 节点上启用 `async-scheduling`，因为这可能导致预填充阶段性能下降。"

msgid ""
"Assume the P server IP is `192.0.0.1`, and the D server IPs are `192.0.0.3` "
"(decoder 1) and `192.0.0.4` (decoder 2)."
msgstr ""
"假设 P 服务器 IP 为 `192.0.0.1`，D 服务器 IP 为 `192.0.0.3`（解码器 1）和 `192.0.0.4`（解码器 2）。"

