msgid "=== \"Verification\""
msgstr "=== \"验证\""

msgid "Check service health using the proxy server endpoint."
msgstr "使用代理服务器端点检查服务健康状态。"

msgid ""
"To verify CPP is active on the P node, check the startup logs for profiling-"
"related messages such as `profiling_chunk_config` enabled and chunk size "
"calculation outputs."
msgstr ""
"要验证 P 节点上的 CPP 是否已激活，请检查启动日志中与性能分析相关的消息，例如 `profiling_chunk_config` "
"已启用以及分块大小计算输出。"

msgid ""
"> **Key Parameters**\n"
">\n"
"> - `--pipeline-parallel-size 2`: Enables Pipeline Parallelism (required, P node only)\n"
"> - `--enable-chunked-prefill`: Enables Chunked Prefill (required, P node only)\n"
"> - `--max-num-batched-tokens 32768`: Initial chunk size (recommended for 128K sequences)\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.enabled`: Enables Dynamic Chunked Pipeline Parallel\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.smooth_factor`:  Smoothing factor (0 < x ≤ 1.0). Higher values trust dynamic prediction more\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.min_chunk`: Minimum chunk size for dynamic calculation. Should be smaller than `max-num-batched-tokens`\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.need_timing`: Enable/disable Online Calibration\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.max_fit_chunk`: Number of chunk-time data for Online Calibration. Should be more when profiling failed\n"
">\n"
"> **Key points for PD disaggregation with CPP:**\n"
">\n"
"> - CPP (`profiling_chunk_config.enabled`, `--pipeline-parallel-size > 1`) is configured **only on the P node**.\n"
"> - The D nodes run without pipeline parallelism (DP32 TP1 standard configuration) — they focus on low-latency token-by-token decoding.\n"
"> - For complete PD disaggregation setup instructions (environment verification, Mooncake installation, proxy deployment), see:\n"
">     - [PD Disaggregation Single Node](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_single_node.md)\n"
">     - [PD Disaggregation Multi Node](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)"
msgstr ""
"> **关键参数**\n"
">\n"
"> - `--pipeline-parallel-size 2`：启用流水线并行（必需，仅 P 节点）\n"
"> - `--enable-chunked-prefill`：启用分块预填充（必需，仅 P 节点）\n"
"> - `--max-num-batched-tokens 32768`：初始分块大小（建议用于 128K 序列）\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.enabled`：启用动态分块流水线并行\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.smooth_factor`：平滑因子（0 < x ≤ 1.0）。值越高越信任动态预测\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.min_chunk`：动态计算的最小分块大小。应小于 `max-num-batched-tokens`\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.need_timing`：启用/禁用在线校准\n"
"> - `profiling_chunk_config.max_fit_chunk`：在线校准的分块时间数据数量。性能分析失败时应增加\n"
">\n"
"> **使用 CPP 进行 PD 分离的关键点：**\n"
">\n"
"> - CPP（`profiling_chunk_config.enabled`、`--pipeline-parallel-size > 1`）**仅在 P 节点上**配置。\n"
"> - D 节点不启用流水线并行（DP32 TP1 标准配置）——它们专注于低延迟的逐令牌解码。\n"
"> - 有关完整的 PD 分离设置说明（环境验证、Mooncake 安装、代理部署），请参阅：\n"
">     - [PD 分离单节点](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_single_node.md)\n"
">     - [PD 分离多节点](pd_disaggregation_mooncake_multi_node.md)"

msgid "## Online Calibration"
msgstr "## 在线校准"

msgid ""
"To evaluate the effectiveness of Dynamic Chunked Pipeline Parallel in PD "
"disaggregation long sequence LLM inference scenarios, we use "
"**DeepSeek-V3.1-W8A8** and **Qwen3-235B**, deploy prefill instance in Ascend"
" Atlas 800T A3 server (64GB × 16), the configuration and performance data "
"are as follows."
msgstr ""
"为了评估动态分块流水线并行在 PD 分离长序列 LLM 推理场景中的有效性，我们使用 **DeepSeek-V3.1-W8A8** 和 "
"**Qwen3-235B**，在 Ascend Atlas 800T A3 服务器（64GB × 16）上部署预填充实例，配置和性能数据如下。"

msgid "    | Input length 128k | TTFT: 22.5s | TTFT: 27.0s |"
msgstr "    | 输入长度 128k | TTFT：22.5s | TTFT：27.0s |"

msgid "    | Input length 256k | TTFT: 53.5s | TTFT: 61.4s |"
msgstr "    | 输入长度256k | TTFT: 53.5s | TTFT: 61.4s |"

msgid "    | CPP2TP8 | Input throughput: 22424 tps/card |"
msgstr "    | CPP2TP8 | 输入吞吐量: 22424 tps/卡 |"

msgid "    | DP2TP8 | Input throughput: 16150 tps/card |"
msgstr "    | DP2TP8 | 输入吞吐量: 16150 tps/卡 |"

msgid "    | TP16 | Input throughput: 18875 tps/card |"
msgstr "    | TP16 | 输入吞吐量: 18875 tps/卡 |"
